{"id":"97b4d5e7181b206d","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-quotient-ring.md","title":"Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","display":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-quotient-ring","aliases":["62-df-quotient-ring"],"display":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","depends_on":["[[62-df-ring-ideal]]","[[62-df-countable-ring]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.5.2","source_pages":[116],"source_pdf_pages":[134]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-quotient-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-quotient-ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" href=\"?note=6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" title=\"62-df-ring-ideal\">62-df-ring-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed16692e1133791f\" href=\"?note=ed16692e1133791f\" title=\"62-df-countable-ring\">62-df-countable-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.5.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>116</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R,I\">\\(\\mathcal R,I\\)</span> 的真理想条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" href=\"?note=6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" title=\"62-df-ring-ideal\">62-df-ring-ideal</a>；环元组和运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed16692e1133791f\" href=\"?note=ed16692e1133791f\" title=\"62-df-countable-ring\">62-df-countable-ring</a>；数值配对和函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。Rep、QuotMap、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_I\">\\(Q_I\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R/I\">\\(\\mathcal R/I\\)</span> 在下式引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_I(r)\">\\(q_I(r)\\)</span> 只在 QuotMap 的唯一输出意义下使用。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rep}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rep}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QuotMap}\">\\(\\mathsf{QuotMap}\\)</span> 作为谓词对所有适型输入解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_I(r)\">\\(q_I(r)\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R\">\\(\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I\">\\(A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\)</span> 假设下构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s&lt;t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&amp;\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s&lt;t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&amp;\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同余类用数码最小代表，而不是以集合论的等价类作为 L₂ 对象。对 r，r 本身属于其同余类，所以在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\le r\">\\(t\\le r\\)</span> 中最小化有见证；真理想闭包给等价关系，保证代表唯一。环运算图是输入已给总图的复合，属 Δ⁰₁ 定义；RCA₀ 形成这些集合和总图，不使用普遍值域理解。两个常元是基环常元的代表，不预设等于自然数 0、1。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition III.5.2；纸面页 116；PDF 页 134。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ring-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ring-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-countable-ring","status":"resolved","id":"ed16692e1133791f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-countable-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ring-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R,I$ 的真理想条件见 [[62-df-ring-ideal]]；环元组和运算见 [[62-df-countable-ring]]；数值配对和函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。Rep、QuotMap、$Q_I$ 及 $\\mathcal R/I$ 在下式引入；$q_I(r)$ 只在 QuotMap 的唯一输出意义下使用。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-countable-ring","status":"resolved","id":"ed16692e1133791f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R,I$ 的真理想条件见 [[62-df-ring-ideal]]；环元组和运算见 [[62-df-countable-ring]]；数值配对和函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。Rep、QuotMap、$Q_I$ 及 $\\mathcal R/I$ 在下式引入；$q_I(r)$ 只在 QuotMap 的唯一输出意义下使用。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R,I$ 的真理想条件见 [[62-df-ring-ideal]]；环元组和运算见 [[62-df-countable-ring]]；数值配对和函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。Rep、QuotMap、$Q_I$ 及 $\\mathcal R/I$ 在下式引入；$q_I(r)$ 只在 QuotMap 的唯一输出意义下使用。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R,I","display":false},{"tex":"Q_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R/I","display":false},{"tex":"q_I(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rep}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{QuotMap}","display":false},{"tex":"q_I(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s<t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t).","display":true},{"tex":"t\\le r","display":false}],"bytes":2452,"backlinks":[{"id":"74ce06f3ea39afa2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，$q_I,\\mathcal R/I$ 见 [[62-df-quotient-ring]]，Ring、IDom、Field 见 [[62-df-countable-ring]]、[[62-df-countable-field]]，Ideal、Prime、MaxIdeal、RadIdeal 见 [[62-df-ring-ideal]]、[[62-df-prime-maximal-radical-ideal]]。UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring|Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives]]"},{"id":"8977785096757e51","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring]]"}],"outgoing":["6ff96e7e7c8bbf63","ed16692e1133791f","c156c03daff0aff0"]}